WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.210
What happens to a copy of&nbsp;
Logan when run through SCP-914?

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:07.930
Dr. Cleveland selected a Blu-ray&nbsp;
copy of the feature film "Logan"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:11.890
for testing, and placed it into the&nbsp;
Clockworks on the setting "Fine."

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:15.430
The output produced was a 1:1&nbsp;
model of Logan's right hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.830
with the claws partially stretched out.

